  "limitations": [
    "Native Windows RTX 4090 support binds only alphastorm/ninfer@v0.6.1-qwen38-4090-beta.1 and its exact package; a managed stop saves every live session, while a crash, a power loss, or a stop whose graceful wait expires still loses what was never published.",
    "Native Windows RTX 3090 support binds only the exact parity package published at alphastorm/ninfer@v0.3.0-qwen38-3090.1; unattended evidence-role activation stays disabled.",
    "Sibling branches beyond the first re-materialize the shared base from host KV (~15 s at 67.7K tokens) until shared-page fanout lands (alphastorm/ninfer#34).",
    "Checkpoints are bound to the exact runtime fingerprint: sessions saved by an older release replay from the OMP transcript once after an upgrade.",
    "Structured JSON-schema output, multi-GPU, multi-tenant, priority, preemption, and silent cloud fallback are unsupported.",
    "Measured throughput and latency apply only to the recorded package, machine, and profile."
